{
    "title": "GlassesOn | Pupils & Lenses",
    "description": "<b>#1 Ranked App for obtaining Pupillary Distance. </b>\r\nThe only medical grade app for PD (Pupillary Distance) and extracting your glasses parameters! \r\n\r\n<b>Getting your glasses parameters has never been easier! </b>\r\nGet everything you need to buy new glasses or AR / VR headset from the comfort of your home.\r\nGet your PD (Pupillary Distance) in less than a minute and get your glasses parameters in less than 10 minutes!!!\r\n\r\nGlassesOn uses cutting-edge computer vision to scan glasses for their optical parameters to provide you with the glasses parameters including sphere (power), cylinder (astigmatism), axis, and PD (Pupillary Distance).\r\n\r\n<b>Key features:</b>\r\n\r\n* Free PD (Pupillary Distance) information\r\n* Unlimited glasses scans \r\n* Fast and easy to use\r\n* Meets the industry guidelines for accuracy (ANSI Z80.17) within 0.25D, PD within 2mm.\r\n* FDA, CE, Health Canada and TGA listed\r\n\r\n<b>How it works: </b>\r\nTo use GlassesOn to get your PD you will need any standard magnetic card (e.g. a library card), light colored cards work best \r\nTo use GlassesOn for extract your glasses parameters you will need:\r\n\r\n* A 12\"-27\" computer screen \r\n* Your current glasses \r\n* Any standard magnetic card (e.g. a library card)\r\n\r\n<b>How to obtain your PD (pupillary distance)?</b>\r\nTap \u201cStart PD\u201d on the home page and follow the voice instructions. GlassesOn will do the rest, it\u2019s that easy :) No ruler, no mirrors and no manual adjustments needed.\r\n\r\n<b>Who can use GlassesOn? </b>\r\nAnyone can use GlassesOn for PD information for FREE! \r\n\r\nUse our premium GlassesOn to extract your glasses details if you:\r\n\r\n* Are a healthy individual, 18 or older\r\n* Have stable vision, and are happy with your current prescription \r\n* Use GlassesOn for Single Vision prescription glasses between -6.00 and +3.00\r\n* Use GlassesOn for glasses with cylinder measurement up to -2.50\r\n\r\n<b>You should not use GlassesOn for:</b>\r\n\r\n* Multifocal/bifocal/progressives eyeglasses\r\n* Glasses that include a prism measurement\r\n\r\n<b>You should not use GlassesOn if you:</b>\r\n\r\n* Take any medication that affects your vision\r\n* Have any illness or condition that affects eye health (ask your doctor)\r\n\r\n<b>This app is not a substitute for an in-person visit to your eye doctor or any kind of eye exam. The parameters extracted from the scanned glasses are not a prescription.</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n* We respect your privacy. \r\n\r\nOur privacy policy clearly states what information we collect when you visit our website and/or use our app. See our full privacy policy here:  \r\nhttps://luna.io/trust/privacy/\r\n\r\n** Note - GlassesOn is a Medical Device listed in the FDA Medical Device Listings, CE (EU) self-declared Class 1, Health Canada and a TGA Medical Device Listings. However, GlassesOn does not provide medical advice and does not replace a full eye health exam. We encourage you to visit your eye doctor periodically.\r\n\r\nManufactured by 6over6 Vision Ltd. \r\nFor more details go to https://6over6.com/",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>#1 Ranked App for obtaining Pupillary Distance. </b><br>The only medical grade app for PD (Pupillary Distance) and extracting your glasses parameters! <br><br><b>Getting your glasses parameters has never been easier! </b><br>Get everything you need to buy new glasses or AR / VR headset from the comfort of your home.<br>Get your PD (Pupillary Distance) in less than a minute and get your glasses parameters in less than 10 minutes!!!<br><br>GlassesOn uses cutting-edge computer vision to scan glasses for their optical parameters to provide you with the glasses parameters including sphere (power), cylinder (astigmatism), axis, and PD (Pupillary Distance).<br><br><b>Key features:</b><br><br>* Free PD (Pupillary Distance) information<br>* Unlimited glasses scans <br>* Fast and easy to use<br>* Meets the industry guidelines for accuracy (ANSI Z80.17) within 0.25D, PD within 2mm.<br>* FDA, CE, Health Canada and TGA listed<br><br><b>How it works: </b><br>To use GlassesOn to get your PD you will need any standard magnetic card (e.g. a library card), light colored cards work best <br>To use GlassesOn for extract your glasses parameters you will need:<br><br>* A 12&quot;-27&quot; computer screen <br>* Your current glasses <br>* Any standard magnetic card (e.g. a library card)<br><br><b>How to obtain your PD (pupillary distance)?</b><br>Tap \u201cStart PD\u201d on the home page and follow the voice instructions. GlassesOn will do the rest, it\u2019s that easy :) No ruler, no mirrors and no manual adjustments needed.<br><br><b>Who can use GlassesOn? </b><br>Anyone can use GlassesOn for PD information for FREE! <br><br>Use our premium GlassesOn to extract your glasses details if you:<br><br>* Are a healthy individual, 18 or older<br>* Have stable vision, and are happy with your current prescription <br>* Use GlassesOn for Single Vision prescription glasses between -6.00 and +3.00<br>* Use GlassesOn for glasses with cylinder measurement up to -2.50<br><br><b>You should not use GlassesOn for:</b><br><br>* Multifocal/bifocal/progressives eyeglasses<br>* Glasses that include a prism measurement<br><br><b>You should not use GlassesOn if you:</b><br><br>* Take any medication that affects your vision<br>* Have any illness or condition that affects eye health (ask your doctor)<br><br><b>This app is not a substitute for an in-person visit to your eye doctor or any kind of eye exam. The parameters extracted from the scanned glasses are not a prescription.</b><br><br><br>* We respect your privacy. <br><br>Our privacy policy clearly states what information we collect when you visit our website and/or use our app. See our full privacy policy here:  <br>https://luna.io/trust/privacy/<br><br>** Note - GlassesOn is a Medical Device listed in the FDA Medical Device Listings, CE (EU) self-declared Class 1, Health Canada and a TGA Medical Device Listings. However, GlassesOn does not provide medical advice and does not replace a full eye health exam. We encourage you to visit your eye doctor periodically.<br><br>Manufactured by 6over6 Vision Ltd. <br>For more details go to https://6over6.com/",
